Added 2026: pebble/, a Bedrock-native Bun/React adaptation of Gatus's
endpoint/result/event/hourly-summary concepts and compact card/history visual
language. The implementation replaces Go/Vue runtime behavior; it does not run
Gatus or copy its alert evaluator. Monitoring layout follows the separately
supplied Bedrock monitoring handoff and the owner's existing app-shell and
activity-bar patterns. New/modified adaptation files are under pebble/.
